      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.34819793701172,
        408.4232177734375,
        82.22920227050781
      ],
      "text": "What is the certainty of the evidence of resource requirements (costs)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.16522979736328,
        526.7282104492188,
        106.31022644042969
      ],
      "text": "Available per-test cost data were unpublished but did include overheads, equipment,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.66522979736328,
        527.0318603515625,
        121.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "building, staff and consumable costs; however, complete quality assessment of the study",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        526.9644775390625,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "was not possible. Test cost will vary according to testing volume and laboratory operations.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        526.585205078125,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "There is limited evidence to assess the important variability across sites, countries and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        212.5446014404297,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "implementation approaches.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        179.35614013671875,
        503.5233154296875,
        192.2371368408203
      ],
      "text": "Does the cost–effectiveness of the intervention favour the intervention or the comparison?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.17303466796875,
        526.8934326171875,
        216.3180389404297
      ],
      "text": "No studies were identified that assessed cost–effectiveness for any of the moderate complexity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.97692584991455,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.67303466796875,
        526.6829223632812,
        231.8180389404297
      ],
      "text": "automated NAATs, and extrapolation was not appropriate given differences in standard of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.17303466796875,
        526.7742919921875,
        247.3180389404297
      ],
      "text": "care, care cascades and associated costs, operational conditions, testing volume and diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.969908714294434,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        249.67303466796875,
        526.9734497070312,
        262.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "accuracy. Implementation considerations (e.g. test placement, laboratory network and ability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        265.17303466796875,
        524.4146728515625,
        278.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "of the programme to initiate treatment quickly) are all likely to affect unit test cost and cost–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        280.67303466796875,
        526.9644775390625,
        293.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "effectiveness. Economic modelling is needed across various settings to understand the range",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        296.17303466796875,
        526.9645385742188,
        309.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "of cost–effectiveness profiles of moderate complexity automated NAATs, and how they are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.67303466796875,
        307.4832763671875,
        324.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "likely to vary under different operational criteria.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        335.6769104003906,
        527.164306640625,
        348.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "Additional details on economic evidence synthesis and analysis are provided in  Web Annex",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.3309020996094,
        526.9288940429688,
        364.2449035644531
      ],
      "text": "B.12: Systematic literature review of economic evidence for NAATs to detect TB and DR-TB in",
