        392.18853759765625,
        179.01329040527344,
        408.5685119628906
      ],
      "text": "User perspective",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        417.31939697265625,
        527.0711059570312,
        430.46441650390625
      ],
      "text": "This section answers the following questions about  key informants’ views and perspectives",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.994698524475098,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.473388671875,
        356.0715026855469,
        444.38739013671875
      ],
      "text": "on the use of moderate complexity automated NAATs:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.0714111328125,
        78.81909942626953,
        464.2164306640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        451.0714111328125,
        527.1621704101562,
        464.2164306640625
      ],
      "text": "Is there important uncertainty about or variability in how much end-users value the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
