        166.19700622558594,
        479.7164306640625
      ],
      "text": "main outcomes?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.0714111328125,
        78.81909942626953,
        495.2164306640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        482.0714111328125,
        304.98126220703125,
        495.2164306640625
      ],
      "text": "What would be the impact on health equity?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.5714111328125,
        78.81909942626953,
        510.7164306640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        497.5714111328125,
        332.82159423828125,
        510.7164306640625
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention acceptable to key stakeholders?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.0714111328125,
        78.81909942626953,
        526.2164306640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        513.0714111328125,
        289.2623596191406,
        526.2164306640625
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention feasible to implement?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.9100341796875,
        526.6360473632812,
        553.0550537109375
      ],
      "text": "User perspectives on the value, feasibility, usability and acceptability of diagnostic technologies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970861434936523,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.4100341796875,
        526.9150390625,
        568.5550537109375
      ],
      "text": "are important in the implementation of such technologies. If the perspectives of laboratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        570.9100341796875,
        526.7977905273438,
        584.0550537109375
      ],
      "text": "personnel, clinicians, patients and TB programme personnel are not considered, the technologies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.4100341796875,
        456.3227233886719,
        599.5550537109375
      ],
      "text": "risk being inaccessible to and underused by those for whom they are intended.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        608.9139404296875,
        465.8255920410156,
        622.0589599609375
      ],
      "text": "To address questions related to user perspective, two activities were undertaken:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        628.6658935546875,
        78.81909942626953,
        641.8109130859375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        628.6658935546875,
        526.5796508789062,
        641.8109130859375
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review of evidence on user perspectives and experiences with NAATs for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        644.1658935546875,
        526.923828125,
        657.3109130859375
      ],
      "text": "detection of TB and TB drug resistance (moderate and low complexity automated assays, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.945414543151855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        659.6658935546875,
        524.4099731445312,
        672.8109130859375
      ],
      "text": "high complexity hybridization-based assays) was undertaken from July to November 2020.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.1658935546875,
        78.81909942626953,
        688.3109130859375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        675.1658935546875,
        525.9714965820312,
        688.3109130859375
      ],
      "text": "A total of 14 semi-structured interviews with clinicians, programme officers, laboratory staff",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983287811279297,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        690.6658935546875,
        526.9973754882812,
        703.8109130859375
      ],
      "text": "and patient advocates were conducted in India, Moldova and South Africa from October",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        706.1658935546875,
        180.07818603515625,
        719.3109130859375
      ],
      "text": "to November 2020.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        733.0045166015625,
        335.40130615234375,
        746.1495361328125
